下面的代码在线程池中长期运行会导致内存泄漏（value 无法回收、并连带阻止类卸载）。请指出问题并给出修复后的完整代码。

```java
public class Holder {
    private static final ThreadLocal<byte[]> CACHE = new ThreadLocal<>();

    public void handle() {
        CACHE.set(new byte[1024 * 1024]);
        doWork();
    }
}
```

answer.code:
public class Holder {
    private static final ThreadLocal<byte[]> CACHE = new ThreadLocal<>();

    public void handle() {
        try {
            CACHE.set(new byte[1024 * 1024]);
            doWork();
        } finally {
            CACHE.remove();          // 关键：归还前清理，避免线程复用时泄漏
        }
    }

    private void doWork() { /* ... */ }
}

